"deviations":"- Kit experience audit/harness/robodojo_physics_only.kit instead of isaaclab.python.kit (no RTX, replicator, camera or\n  viewport extensions); AppLauncher is bypassed and its carb settings are set as evaluation sets them, except that\n  cameras and the offscreen flag are off (offscreen needs the viewport extension); evaluation's PARTIAL_RENDERING\n  render() (forward, then app.update with playSimulations off) is reproduced by patching SimulationContext.render;\n  evaluation's zero-delay render args and camera extensions are not added.\n- sys.modules stubs: CameraManager and TiledCaptureManager (null; reset keeps the per-env reseeding and the one\n  sim_step), create_mdl_material (USD-only Material + Shader, no physics API), WsModelClient (no-op),\n  CuroboPlanner (need_planner false; joint actions never use it), and the policy module (a local scripted policy).\n- `env`, `task` and `utils` are pinned to the repository (namespace packages that Kit's own `utils` shadows).\n- Assets: table and ground MDL files are empty placeholders (visual only); wrist and head camera prims are not created.\n- `utils.load_file.load_pkl` refuses any path under `Assets/Traj` (AGENTS.md: never unpickle it); the three support-arm\n  tasks load those pickles in `run_reward`, so their scoring raises there.\n- Policy `sweep` (#64 population sweep): enables PhysX contact reporting (`disableContactProcessing = False`, `PhysxContactReportAPI` threshold 0.0 on rigid objects; instrumentation only) and the scene-query BVH for the engine collider AABB readback; after reset and readback, steps physics `--sweep_steps` times with no new robot command (`sim_step`, drive targets as reset left them) while sampling poses; then one hold action through `take_action` (arm targets = measured joints, gripper = last command) and the evaluator's step-limit check reached at once (`take_action_cnt = step_lim`, `is_episode_end`) instead of holding until the limit.\n- Sweep drop test (`--sweep_drop_m 0.03`): after the settle, every rigid object is lifted 0.03 m (`set_local_pose`), its velocities zeroed, and physics stepped 250 times before the do-nothing verdict, so that verdict is taken after the drop.\n- `spec_readback` / `assert_readback`: enables `PhysxSceneAPI` scene-query BVH (`enable_scene_query_support = True`) for read-only engine collider AABB `overlap_box` verification.",
